00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:32.350
it can be applied
across the value chain.

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:33.550
And this is the theme--

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:37.390
"Bridge From Marketing
to Supply Chain."

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:38.500
I'm Salil Amonkar.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:41.370
